{
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "tfm2_frieren_frieren": {
        "name": "Frieren",
        "skill": "All Frieren-owned raw damage, including basic Zoltraak, Spellcraft, Fern and Stark, is multiplied by 80% once before mitigation. Zoltraak: piercing basic attack (20 + 45% AP), every 1.2s. Concealed Mana: 100 mana, recovering 8/s while alive. Spellcraft: quick shot (50 + 70% AP, 0.35s preparation, 15 mana) or charged shot (85 + 100% AP, 1s preparation, 35 mana). Shared cooldown 4s, spent with mana when preparation starts; disruption cancels the shot. Shots are piercing lines up to 150000 that hit every enemy they cross, minions included; the targeted enemy is marked for the whole preparation. Requires the skill to be learned.",
        "skill2": "Defensive Magic: a breakable shield for Frieren or an ally within 60000 (90 + 45% AP), lasting 1.5s. Costs 30 mana; cooldown 10s. Battle Reading selects protection and firing opportunities using visible actions.",
        "ult": "Stark retains his existing targetable companion. All party raw damage is multiplied by 80% once. Journey’s Companions: 8s of revealed mana (+25% AP, +15% attack speed, +15000 range, 12 mana/s). Fern fires at the selected visible champion every 3s (35 + 55% AP, range 150000). Targetable Stark guards Frieren or her protected ally for 12s: 300 + 25% of her maximum HP, 20 armour, 15 MR, strikes for 40 + 45% AP every 1.5s within 22000 (dealt as Frieren's skill damage), 90000 pursuit leash. Normal skills remain available. Used against a champion while Frieren has at least 35% HP. Cooldown 60s; requires ultimate unlock. Stark leaps once per enemy champion during his summon: a fixed 0.83s warned landing, 2s leap cooldown, 45 + 60% AP magic damage and 0.83s airborne within 20000; 35% slow for 1.75s within 40000. He remains targetable; death, expiry or interruption cancels the landing."
      }
    }
  }
}
